      "content": "CITIZENSHIP (AMENDMENT) ACT, 2019"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 11 gives Parliament exclusive power to make laws regulating citizenship acquisition and termination.",
        "Fundamental rights under Articles 15, 16, 19, 29, and 30 are exclusively available to Indian citizens and not to aliens.",
        "Article 9 establishes the principle of single citizenship by terminating Indian citizenship upon voluntarily acquiring foreign citizenship."
      ],
